  "notes": "Historical material/card import retained as provenance; the inherited hkl/d/intensity array is superseded and preserved privately with its full original document. The present peaks are independent kinematic X-ray calculations (0.8-20 A, sum multiplicity*|F|^2, maximum 100), not measured intensities or a recovered source-card selection. Fe3P-type topology proxy from meteoritic (Fe,Ni)3P COD 9007338: replace all Ni by Fe and P by S. This is not a refined Fe3S structure or a prediction of experimental intensities. The existing Fe3S reference cell is retained. Original scientific EOS evidence, observations and applicability limits are unchanged. The root atom sites now use this same COD-derived Fe3S proxy, replacing the earlier Britvin Fe3P proxy; neither is an experimental Fe3S refinement.",
